From: 0x4D44
Subject: [PATCH] Add mdhavers (.braw) language support

Add support for mdhavers, a Scots programming language that uses
keywords like 'ken' (let), 'gin' (if), 'blether' (print), etc.

mdhavers uses # for single-line comments (like Python/Shell),
with no block comment syntax. The file extension is .braw
(Scots for "good/fine").

More info: https://github.com/0x4d44/mdhavers
---
 src/main.rs | 31 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

